# Data Cleaning and Ingestion

This folder contains the script used to clean and prepare the raw inspection datasets.

## Files Used
- FoodInspectionData.csv
- Closed_Food_Establishments.csv

## Cleaning Steps
- Removed duplicate rows
- Standardized ZIP codes
- Standardized city names
- Converted inspection dates into date format
- Created closure indicator variable
- Created critical violation count variable
- Exported cleaned datasets

## Output Files
- FoodInspectionData_cleaned.csv
- Closed_Food_Establishments_cleaned.csv
